    `the document is a supplementary prospectus or a supplementary profile statement referred to in section 241(1)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the document a supplementary prospectus or supplementary profile statement of the kind section 241(1) refers to?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 239(1) "supplementary document" the document is a supplementary document` MEANS
    IF `the document is a supplementary prospectus or a supplementary profile statement referred to in section 241(1)`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "means a supplementary prospectus or a supplementary profile statement referred to in section 241(1), as the case may be"

-- src:37705 | “trust deed” has the same meaning as “deed” in section 2 of the
-- src:37706 | Business Trusts Act 2004;
@ref s 239(1) "trust deed" (src:37705-37706)
