    `the document is a deed within section 2 of the Business Trusts Act 2004` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the document a "deed" as section 2 of the Business Trusts Act 2004 defines it?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 239(1) "trust deed" the document is a trust deed` MEANS
